  "title": "The Remnants of Jabba's Sail Barge",
  "description": "The charred remains of Jabba's sail barge littered the dunes around the Great Pit of Carkoon. Boba Fett hovered around the pit in his starship, circling the subterranean monster. Adjusting the stabilizers, Fett tilted the starship downwards to face the repulsive opening in the sand. Thinking the sarlacc held his missing armor, he attempted to look inside. The creature jumped to life and grabbed ahold of the ship, and Boba tried to pull away, unleashing blaster fire into the gruesome maw."
